    "text": "wdrb.com\nwebsite\nLexington\nKentucky woman plans to use $50,000 lottery scratch-off winnings to reunite with sister\n7 hours ago\nLOUISVILLE, Ky. (WDRB) -- A Lexington woman plans to reunite with her sister after winning $50,000 from a Kentucky Lottery scratch-off. Donna Hoover won $50,000 from the $5 Lucky Horseshoe Crossword. \"I haven't seen my sister in Tennessee in six years,\" Hoover said in a news release Wednesday. \"In this...\n4",
